    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Walking home in the middle of the day after losing his job, Muranishi discovers his marriage has fallen apart too. After a bitter argument, Sachiko packs up to leave the house, taking Mayumi and little Daisuke with her. Listen to this painful turning point.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "sachiko",
      "t": "何でそんなところにいるのよ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "幸子、どういうことだ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "sachiko",
      "t": "嫌だ！もう終わりよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "みっともない！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "sachiko",
      "t": "みっともないのはあんたでしょ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "俺のどこがみっともないんだ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "daisuke",
      "t": "パパ！ラジコンは？カウンタックは？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "大輔、ごめんな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "これは俺らの問題だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "母さんは口を出すな！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "sachiko",
      "t": "大輔、行くよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "sachiko",
      "t": "ほら、早く行って！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Even during a heated breakup, Japanese relies on compact everyday patterns. Let's look at how each line works.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "sachiko",
      "t": "何でそんなところにいるのよ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why are you standing there?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "幸子、どういうことだ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sachiko, what is the meaning of this?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "sachiko",
      "t": "嫌だ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "みっともない！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How shameful!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "sachiko",
      "t": "みっともないのはあんたでしょ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are the one who is shameful!'",
      "gap": 0.45
